---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sell Your House Fast in Little Rock, AR | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Sell your house fast in Little Rock, AR with Arkansas Property Buyers. We buy houses as-is for cash with no repairs, agent commissions, or showings. Local, family-owned, with flexible closing dates."
>
<!-- HEADER -->
<Header />

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="bg-white pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_420px] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="pt-1 lg:pt-4">
        <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Little Rock's local, family-owned home buyer &middot; Serving Arkansas for over 30 years</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase leading-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-3">Sell Your House Fast in Little Rock, Arkansas</h1>
        <p class="tagline-script mb-6">Real people. Honest answers. Right here in Little Rock.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md">Need to sell a house in Little Rock without the usual hassle? We buy homes directly and as-is, so you can skip repairs, cleanouts, showings, and agent commissions. Whether you're facing foreclosure, handling probate or an inherited property, or simply need to sell fast, our local team will walk you through your options and work around your timeline.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 mb-10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-navy flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm">We Work Around Your Timeline</p>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Need a quick sale or more time to move? We'll discuss a closing date that works for your property and situation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-navy flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm">No Repairs. No Cleanout. No Commissions.</p>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Sell your property as-is. We handle everything from there.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-navy flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8-1.5 0-2.907-.328-4.146-.906L3 20l1.145-3.435C3.42 15.36 3 14.223 3 13c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm">Free Consultation. No Pressure.</p>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Talk through your situation with your local trusted team.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-grey font-body border-t border-gray-100 pt-6">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-navy flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          <span>Based in Little Rock &ndash; helping homeowners throughout Pulaski County and across Arkansas</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="offer-tool" class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
        <div class="bg-navy px-6 py-5">
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase text-lg tracking-wide">Tell us what best describes your situation</h2>
          <p class="font-body text-orange text-sm mt-1">Select your situation and we'll help you understand your options &ndash; takes just 30 seconds!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-6">
          <a href="/get-a-cash-offer-today/" class="block mb-5 text-center bg-orange hover:bg-navy text-white font-sub font-bold text-sm px-5 py-4 rounded transition-colors">Request My No-Obligation Cash Offer</a>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <a href="/avoid-foreclosure" class="group block border-2 border-navy/20 rounded-lg p-5 text-center transition-all shadow-sm hover:border-orange hover:bg-orange/5 hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer">
              <span class="block text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📋</span>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide group-hover:text-orange transition-colors">Avoid Foreclosure</h3>
            </a>

            <a href="/probate-help" class="group block border-2 border-navy/20 rounded-lg p-5 text-center transition-all shadow-sm hover:border-orange hover:bg-orange/5 hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer">
              <span class="block text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">⚖️</span>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide group-hover:text-orange transition-colors">Probate Help</h3>
            </a>

            <a href="/senior-living-transition" class="group block border-2 border-navy/20 rounded-lg p-5 text-center transition-all shadow-sm hover:border-orange hover:bg-orange/5 hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer">
              <span class="block text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📦</span>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide group-hover:text-orange transition-colors">Senior Living Transition</h3>
            </a>

            <a href="/sell-my-house-as-is" class="group block border-2 border-navy/20 rounded-lg p-5 text-center transition-all shadow-sm hover:border-orange hover:bg-orange/5 hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer">
              <span class="block text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🔧</span>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide group-hover:text-orange transition-colors">Sell My House As-Is</h3>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 text-center">
            <p class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Prefer to talk it through first?</p>
            <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-navy hover:bg-orange text-white font-sub font-bold text-sm px-6 py-4 rounded transition-all uppercase tracking-wider w-full shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
              Call (501) 504-7109
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
<section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Why Little Rock Homeowners Choose Us</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight max-w-lg">What Makes Us Different From the Rest</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 gap-y-10">
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Little Rock-Based &amp; Family-Owned</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We're not a national investment fund or an out-of-state buyer. We're a Little Rock-based Arkansas family that has been helping homeowners across the state for over 30 years.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">No Fees. No Commissions.</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">You don't pay agent commissions when you sell directly to us. We'll explain the purchase price and closing terms so you can compare your options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Sell As-Is – No Repairs Needed</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Sell your property exactly as it sits. No repairs, no cleaning, no contractors. We handle everything after closing so you don't have to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">You Choose the Closing Date</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Every situation has a different timeline. Whether you need to close quickly or need more time to plan your next move, we work around you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Honest Guidance. No Pressure.</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We'll give you straightforward information about your options and let you make the decision that's right for you – no high-pressure tactics, ever.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lift">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">We Cover All Closing Costs</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We cover closing costs as agreed in your purchase contract. Mortgage payoffs, liens, unpaid taxes, or other seller obligations can reduce your proceeds. Review the closing statement to see what you'll receive.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="bg-gray-50 py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">A Simple, Transparent Process</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight">Here's How It Works</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-grey mt-3 text-base max-w-sm mx-auto">No surprises, no pressure – just a straightforward path forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 font-display font-bold text-xl">1</div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Tell Us About Your Situation</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Reach out by phone or fill out our short form. There's no obligation – we just want to understand what you're dealing with so we can offer real, relevant guidance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 font-display font-bold text-xl">2</div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">We Walk Through Your Options</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We'll evaluate your property and present a fair, transparent offer – and honestly discuss any alternatives that might serve you better. No pressure, no rush.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 font-display font-bold text-xl">3</div>
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Close on Your Schedule</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">If our offer is the right fit, you pick the closing date. We handle all the paperwork and cover the closing costs. That's it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OFFER AND SELLING OPTIONS -->
<section aria-labelledby="cash-offer-heading" class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Understand Your Offer</p>
        <h2 id="cash-offer-heading" class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight mb-5">How We Evaluate Your Little Rock House</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">A cash offer starts with the property itself: its location, condition, repair needs, and comparable home sales. An updated house and a house needing major work have different costs and risks. Tell us about the roof, heating and cooling, any known damage, and whether the home is occupied so we can discuss your situation.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-5">Ask us to explain the offer and the terms before you decide. There is no obligation to accept. You can also <a href="/how-we-buy-houses/" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">see how our buying process works</a>, from the first conversation through closing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xl mb-4">Should You Sell for Cash or List With an Agent?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">Listing may bring a higher sale price if you have time for preparation, showings, and negotiations. A direct cash sale may suit you if avoiding repairs, cleanouts, or the uncertainty of buyer financing matters more.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-5">Compare what you expect to keep after repairs, commissions, holding costs, and any mortgage or other obligations. The best choice depends on your home, timeline, and priorities.</p>
        <a href="/compare/" class="font-sub font-bold text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">Compare a cash sale with listing your house</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100">
        <img src="/images/apbteam.png?v=3" alt="Arkansas Property Buyers team" class="w-full object-cover aspect-[4/3]">
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">About Our Team</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight mb-3">A Little Rock Team.<br>Helping Arkansas Families.</h2>
        <p class="tagline-script mb-5">We've been your neighbors for over 30 years.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm">Randy and the Arkansas Property Buyers team have been helping homeowners navigate difficult real estate situations for more than three decades. We're a family-owned company based right here in Little Rock – not a national brand, not an out-of-state investor.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-grey leading-relaxed mb-7 text-sm">We understand that selling a home is often about much more than real estate. Whether you're managing a loved one's estate, facing financial hardship, or simply need to move on from a property without the stress of repairs and showings – we're here to help you think through your options honestly and without pressure.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-sub font-bold text-navy">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            Family-owned and Arkansas-based
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-sub font-bold text-navy">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            Over 30 years serving Arkansas homeowners
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-sub font-bold text-navy">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            Experienced in complex and difficult situations
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section id="testimonials" class="bg-gray-50 py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">What Homeowners Say</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight">Real Experiences From Little Rock &amp; Arkansas Homeowners</h2>
      <p class="font-body text-grey mt-3 text-sm">We measure success by whether the people we work with walk away feeling good about the outcome.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-7">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
