    <h2 id="seller-questions-heading" class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight mb-8">Questions About Selling a House in Little Rock</h2>
    <div class="divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200">
      <details class="py-5">
        <summary class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-lg cursor-pointer">Can I sell my house without making repairs or cleaning it out?</summary>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. We buy homes in their current condition. Tell us what needs work and what you would like to leave behind so those details can be agreed before closing. Learn more about <a href="/sell-my-house-as-is/" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">selling your house as-is</a>.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="py-5">
        <summary class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-lg cursor-pointer">How quickly can a cash sale close?</summary>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">Timing depends on the purchase agreement, title review, any required approvals, and when you are ready to move. Tell us your preferred date at the start. If an auction or another deadline is approaching, contact us promptly so we can discuss whether a sale is feasible in time.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="py-5">
        <summary class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-lg cursor-pointer">Can you buy an inherited house or a rental property?</summary>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">We consider inherited homes and occupied or vacant rentals. Tell us who owns the property and whether tenants or an estate are involved. The sale must be authorized and any title or occupancy issues addressed as part of the closing process. Our <a href="/probate-help/" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">inherited and probate property guide</a> explains how we can help you explore a sale.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="py-5">
        <summary class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-lg cursor-pointer">Do I have to accept your cash offer?</summary>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-3">No. Requesting an offer does not commit you to selling. Review the written price, closing terms, and expected proceeds, and compare them with your other options before signing a purchase agreement.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
    <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-6">Have another question? <a href="/faq/" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">Read more seller FAQs</a> or call <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">(501) 504-7109</a>.</p>
